%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cc2c2f7ffb245e641b8a8104a6d7dc54, type: 3}
  m_Name: DialogueDictionary
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueDictionary:
    _serializedList:
    - Key: David_Ellipsis
      Value:
        dialogueCharacterSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 206a9c7f94fa46a4bb93deab729f915c, type: 2}
        text: ...
    - Key: David_Shocked
      Value:
        dialogueCharacterSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 206a9c7f94fa46a4bb93deab729f915c, type: 2}
        text: '!!!'
    - Key: Dracula_OpeningDialogue_01
      Value:
        dialogueCharacterSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a54d4654070a69049a3e01a6c5e78d7f, type: 2}
        text: Ah... What a predictable outcome. A mere human, brash, reckless and
          utterly lacking in grace as usual. Smashing through my ancient, irreplaceable
          castle walls with... this.
    - Key: Dracula_OpeningDialogue_02
      Value:
        dialogueCharacterSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a54d4654070a69049a3e01a6c5e78d7f, type: 2}
        text: Well, since you seem so eager to part with your possessions... I shall
          take this.
    - Key: Dracula_OpeningDialogue_03
      Value:
        dialogueCharacterSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a54d4654070a69049a3e01a6c5e78d7f, type: 2}
        text: Yes... a fitting compensation for the insult you have delivered upon
          my home.
    - Key: Dracula_OpeningDialogue_04
      Value:
        dialogueCharacterSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a54d4654070a69049a3e01a6c5e78d7f, type: 2}
        text: As for you, I would suggest you scram!
    - Key: Oswald_OswaldIntroduction_01
      Value:
        dialogueCharacterSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6090bbc712dfde848b703d0993ec28a3, type: 2}
        text: Bzzz... zzz.. Hel...btzzz...oOo...bzz
    - Key: Oswald_OswaldIntroduction_02
      Value:
        dialogueCharacterSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6090bbc712dfde848b703d0993ec28a3, type: 2}
        text: HELLO! Hiiii! Great this works! I'm Oswald the Befuddled.
    - Key: Oswald_OswaldIntroduction_03
      Value:
        dialogueCharacterSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6090bbc712dfde848b703d0993ec28a3, type: 2}
        text: Wizard extraordinaire, castle prisoner, and now your official guide
          to not dying in this madhouse.
    - Key: Oswald_OswaldIntroduction_04
      Value:
        dialogueCharacterSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6090bbc712dfde848b703d0993ec28a3, type: 2}
        text: That flashy thing Dracula stole? Your car- You want that back right?
    - Key: Oswald_OswaldIntroduction_05
      Value:
        dialogueCharacterSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6090bbc712dfde848b703d0993ec28a3, type: 2}
        text: 'Good news: I can help! Bad news: this place is crawling with traps
          and goons.'
    - Key: Oswald_OswaldIntroduction_06
      Value:
        dialogueCharacterSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6090bbc712dfde848b703d0993ec28a3, type: 2}
        text: More good news! I've scattered some magical tips around the castle.
          Call it... wizard graffiti, if you will. Keep your eyes peeled! And don't
          worry, I'll check in from time to time.
    - Key: Oswald_OswaldIntroduction_07
      Value:
        dialogueCharacterSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6090bbc712dfde848b703d0993ec28a3, type: 2}
        text: Off you go kiddo!
    - Key: Oswald_EntranceHall_Checkpoint1_01
      Value:
        dialogueCharacterSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6090bbc712dfde848b703d0993ec28a3, type: 2}
        text: You're on fire, kid! Look at those moves! Oh, and remember those goons
          I mentioned?
    - Key: Oswald_EntranceHall_Checkpoint1_02
      Value:
        dialogueCharacterSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6090bbc712dfde848b703d0993ec28a3, type: 2}
        text: Yeah, they're just up ahead, so keep your eyes peeled and your wits
          sharper than a vampire's fangs!
    - Key: Oswald_EntranceHall_Checkpoint2_01
      Value:
        dialogueCharacterSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6090bbc712dfde848b703d0993ec28a3, type: 2}
        text: Ya-ho! You're tearing through this place like a kid in a candy store!
          Oh, and guess what?
    - Key: Oswald_EntranceHall_Checkpoint2_02
      Value:
        dialogueCharacterSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6090bbc712dfde848b703d0993ec28a3, type: 2}
        text: That weapon of you yeah? Well I gave it a little tweak. Now every
          time you pull off something flashy, you'll get a sweet boost!
    - Key: Oswald_EntranceHall_Checkpoint2_03
      Value:
        dialogueCharacterSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6090bbc712dfde848b703d0993ec28a3, type: 2}
        text: Go on, try it out up ahead. Show em what you've got, champ!
    - Key: Drucilla_DrucillaIntroduction_01
      Value:
        dialogueCharacterSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7afd6b2200475f747aa660368f34970a, type: 2}
        text: Is this what my father's castle has been reduced too? Filthy
          peasants intruding and tracking mud across the marble?
    - Key: Drucilla_DrucillaIntroduction_02
      Value:
        dialogueCharacterSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7afd6b2200475f747aa660368f34970a, type: 2}
        text: Well, you clearly have no idea whose presence you've just barged
          into. Let me take some pity and educate you on the matter.
    - Key: Drucilla_DrucillaIntroduction_03
      Value:
        dialogueCharacterSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7afd6b2200475f747aa660368f34970a, type: 2}
        text: I am Drucilla, daughter of the almighty Dracula, heir to his eternal
          dominion, and most importantly-
    - Key: Drucilla_DrucillaIntroduction_04
      Value:
        dialogueCharacterSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7afd6b2200475f747aa660368f34970a, type: 2}
        text: Daddy's little princess!
    - Key: Drucilla_DrucillaIntroduction_05
      Value:
        dialogueCharacterSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7afd6b2200475f747aa660368f34970a, type: 2}
        text: This castle? Mine.
    - Key: Drucilla_DrucillaIntroduction_06
      Value:
        dialogueCharacterSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7afd6b2200475f747aa660368f34970a, type: 2}
        text: The night itself? Mine.
    - Key: Drucilla_DrucillaIntroduction_07
      Value:
        dialogueCharacterSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7afd6b2200475f747aa660368f34970a, type: 2}
        text: Your pathetic excuse for a fate? Oh, that, too, belongs to me.
    - Key: Drucilla_DrucillaIntroduction_08
      Value:
        dialogueCharacterSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7afd6b2200475f747aa660368f34970a, type: 2}
        text: And yet, you march in here like some bold little hero, thinking you
          stand a chance? Ohhh, that is just hilarious!
    - Key: Drucilla_DrucillaIntroduction_09
      Value:
        dialogueCharacterSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7afd6b2200475f747aa660368f34970a, type: 2}
        text: Even the rats in my father's dungeon have more refinement than
          you. Shall we see how you fair against them?
    - Key: Drucilla_DrucillaIntroduction_10
      Value:
        dialogueCharacterSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7afd6b2200475f747aa660368f34970a, type: 2}
        text: Buh-bye, peasant!
